<title>USA: Advanced Micro sues Alliance Semiconductor.</title>
<headline>Advanced Micro sues Alliance Semiconductor.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanced Micro Devices said on Thursday it filed a patent infringement suit against Alliance Semiconductor International Corp.</p>
<p>The suit, filed in U.S. District Court in San Jose, Calif., alleges Alliance is infringing on certain Advanced Micro patents that cover flash-memory technology.</p>
<p>The suit asks for preliminary and permanent injunctions, an accounting of damages, the trebling of damages, interest on damages and an award of attorney's fees and costs.</p>
<p>Officials at Alliance Semiconductor were not immediately available to comment.</p>
